      785               run trg/rsrv-dtl.p (
      786                     input p-parent-proc
      787                   , input 'reserv':U
      788                           + ",":U + 'no-message':U
      789                           + ",":U + 'negative-check':U + '=':U + '1':U
      790                   , buffer buf_gds-dtl
